#~ msgid "目标"
#~ msgstr "Objectives"

#~ msgid "一、RBM 原理概述"
#~ msgstr "I. RBM Principles Overview"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "受限玻尔兹曼机（Restricted Boltzmann Machine, "
#~ "RBM）是一种基于能量的概率图模型，由可见层（Visible Layer）和隐层（Hidden "
#~ "Layer）组成，层内无连接，层间全连接。其核心是通过无监督学习学习数据的潜在特征分布。DBN 的关键思想是把上一层 "
#~ "RBM 输出的隐层概率或采样结果作为下一层 RBM 的可见层，逐层学习越来越抽象的表示。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A Restricted Boltzmann Machine (RBM) is"
#~ " an energy-based probabilistic graphical"
#~ " model consisting of a Visible Layer"
#~ " and a Hidden Layer with no "
#~ "intra-layer connections and full inter-"
#~ "layer connections.  Its core task is "
#~ "to learn the latent feature distribution"
#~ " of data via unsupervised learning. A"
#~ " DBN uses the hidden probabilities or"
#~ " samples from one RBM as the "
#~ "visible input of the next, learning "
#~ "increasingly abstract features layer by "
#~ "layer."

#~ msgid "1. 模型结构"
#~ msgstr "1\\. Model Structure"

#~ msgid "**可见层（`v`）**：输入数据的显式表示（如像素值）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Visible layer (``v``)**: explicit "
#~ "representation of input data (e.g. pixel"
#~ " values)."

#~ msgid "**隐层（`h`）**：提取的潜在特征。"
#~ msgstr "**Hidden layer (``h``)**: extracted latent features."

#~ msgid "**权重矩阵（`W`）**：连接可见层与隐层的权重。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Weight matrix (``W``)**: weights connecting"
#~ " visible and hidden layers."

#~ msgid "**偏置**：可见层偏置（`b`）和隐层偏置（`c`）。"
#~ msgstr "**Biases**: visible bias (``b``) and hidden bias (``c``)."

#~ msgid "2. 能量函数与概率分布"
#~ msgstr "2\\. Energy Function & Probability Distribution"

#~ msgid "RBM 的能量函数定义为："
#~ msgstr "The RBM energy function is defined as:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = -\\mathbf{v}^T W"
#~ " \\mathbf{h} - \\mathbf{b}^T \\mathbf{v} -"
#~ " \\mathbf{c}^T \\mathbf{h}\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = -\\mathbf{v}^T W"
#~ " \\mathbf{h} - \\mathbf{b}^T \\mathbf{v} -"
#~ " \\mathbf{c}^T \\mathbf{h}"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = \\frac{ "
#~ "e^{-E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})} }{Z}\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = \\frac{ "
#~ "e^{-E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})} }{Z}"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "P(\\mathbf{v}) = \\sum_{\\mathbf{h}} P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})\n"
#~ msgstr "P(\\mathbf{v}) = \\sum_{\\mathbf{h}} P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})"

#~ msgid "3. 条件独立性"
#~ msgstr "3\\. Conditional Independence"

#~ msgid "由于层内无连接，给定可见层时隐层条件独立，反之亦然："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Because there are no within-layer "
#~ "connections, the hidden units are "
#~ "conditionally independent given the visible"
#~ " layer, and vice versa:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "P(h_j=1|\\mathbf{v}) = \\sigma\\left(\\sum_i W_{ij} v_i + c_j\\right)\n"
#~ msgstr "P(h_j=1|\\mathbf{v}) = \\sigma\\left(\\sum_i W_{ij} v_i + c_j\\right)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "P(v_i=1|\\mathbf{h}) = \\sigma\\left(\\sum_j W_{ij} h_j + b_i\\right)\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ msgstr "P(v_i=1|\\mathbf{h}) = \\sigma\\left(\\sum_j W_{ij} h_j + b_i\\right)"

#~ msgid "其中 $\\sigma(x) = \\frac{1}{1+e^{-x}}$ 为 Sigmoid 激活函数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "where $\\sigma(x)=\\frac{1}{1+e^{-x}}$ is the "
#~ "sigmoid activation function."

#~ msgid "4. 训练目标"
#~ msgstr "4\\. Training Objective"

#~ msgid "通过最大化似然函数学习参数（`W`, `b`, `c`）。目标函数为负对数似然："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Parameters (``W``, ``b``, ``c``) are "
#~ "learned by maximizing the likelihood.  "
#~ "The objective is the negative log-"
#~ "likelihood:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "\\mathcal{L} = -\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}} \\log P(\\mathbf{v})\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ msgstr "\\mathcal{L} = -\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}} \\log P(\\mathbf{v})"

#~ msgid "采用对比散度（CD）算法近似梯度，更新规则为："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Contrastive Divergence (CD) is used to"
#~ " approximate gradients.  The update rule"
#~ " is:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "\\Delta W_{ij} = \\epsilon \\left(\\langle "
#~ "v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{data}} - \\langle "
#~ "v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{recon}}\\right)\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\\Delta W_{ij} = \\epsilon \\left(\\langle "
#~ "v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{data}} - \\langle "
#~ "v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{recon}}\\right)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "其中 $\\epsilon$ 为学习率，$\\langle \\cdot "
#~ "\\rangle_{\\text{data}}$ 和 $\\langle \\cdot "
#~ "\\rangle_{\\text{recon}}$ 分别为数据分布和重构分布的期望。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "where $\\epsilon$ is the learning rate,"
#~ " and $\\langle \\cdot \\rangle_{\\text{data}}$"
#~ " and $\\langle \\cdot \\rangle_{\\text{recon}}$"
#~ " denote expectations under the data "
#~ "and reconstruction distributions, respectively."

